#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost Health Check is a comprehensive evaluation of your "
"system's current operational health available to Mattermost Enterprise "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Health Check는 Mattermost Enterprise 고객이 사용할 수 있는, 시스템의 현재 운영 상태에 대한 "
"종합 평가입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:9
msgid ""
"This evaluation provides you with insights based on your system’s "
"configuration, user activity, and log events that helps you proactively "
"identify issues, enhance collaboration security, optimize resource "
"utilization and scalability which leads to minimized downtime, improved "
"performance, and significant cost savings for your Enterprise "
"organization."
msgstr ""
"이 평가는 시스템 구성, 사용자 활동, 로그 이벤트를 기반으로 인사이트를 제공하여 문제를 선제적으로 "
"식별하고, 협업 보안을 강화하며, 리소스 활용과 확장성을 최적화하도록 돕습니다. 이를 통해 "
"Enterprise 조직은 다운타임을 최소화하고 성능을 개선하며 상당한 비용 절감을 달성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:13
msgid ""
"Want to configure your own server health check probes for your self-"
"hosted Mattermost deployment? See the :doc:`configure server health check"
" probes </administration-guide/manage/configure-health-check-probes>` "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"셀프 호스팅 OKR.BEST 배포를 위해 자체 서버 헬스 체크 프로브를 구성하고 싶으신가요? 자세한 "
"내용은 :doc:`서버 헬스 체크 프로브 구성 </administration-guide/manage/configure-health-check-probes>` "
"문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:16
msgid "Why request a Mattermost Health Check?"
msgstr "Mattermost Health Check를 요청해야 하는 이유"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:18
msgid ""
"Regularly assessing the health of your Mattermost environment ensures "
"that:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 환경의 상태를 정기적으로 평가하면 다음을 보장할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:20
msgid "System performance remains optimal, with minimal delays or downtime."
msgstr "지연이나 다운타임을 최소화하면서 시스템 성능을 최적으로 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:21
msgid ""
"User experience is consistently reliable, preventing missed messages or "
"slow load times."
msgstr ""
"누락된 메시지나 느린 로드 시간을 방지하여 사용자 경험을 일관되게 신뢰할 수 있게 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:22
msgid "Security and compliance settings are up-to-date and effective."
msgstr "보안 및 컴플라이언스 설정이 최신 상태이고 효과적으로 유지됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:23
msgid ""
"Scalability aligns with your evolving usage patterns, supporting growth "
"without issues."
msgstr ""
"확장성이 변화하는 사용 패턴에 맞춰 조정되어 문제 없이 성장을 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:26
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "시작하기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:28
msgid ""
"Getting started with a Mattermost Health Check is simple and involves 3 "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Health Check 시작은 간단하며 3단계로 진행됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:30
msgid ""
":doc:`Generate a Support Packet </administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/generating-support-packet>`: The Mattermost Support Packet contains "
"critical information about your Mattermost environment, including logs, "
"configurations, and usage data."
msgstr ""
":doc:`지원 패킷 생성 </administration-guide/manage/admin/generating-support-packet>`: Mattermost "
"지원 패킷에는 로그, 구성, 사용량 데이터를 포함해 OKR.BEST 환경에 대한 중요한 정보가 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:32
msgid ""
"Submit Your Support Packet: Once you’ve generated the Support Packet, "
"submit it through our Support System as a `standard support request "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. Please include "
"“Health Check Provided” in the subject line."
msgstr ""
"지원 패킷 제출: 지원 패킷을 생성한 후 지원 시스템을 통해 `표준 지원 요청 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 으로 제출합니다. 제목 줄에 “Health Check "
"Provided”를 포함하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:34
msgid ""
"Receive Your Health Check Report: Within 2 weeks of submitting your "
"Support Packet, you will receive a comprehensive performance report. This"
" report will include:"
msgstr ""
"Health Check 보고서 받기: 지원 패킷을 제출한 후 2주 이내에 종합 성능 보고서를 받게 됩니다. "
"이 보고서에는 다음이 포함됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:36
msgid "Detailed analysis of your current system health."
msgstr "현재 시스템 상태에 대한 자세한 분석"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:37
msgid ""
"Actionable recommendations to enhance performance, reliability, and "
"security."
msgstr ""
"성능, 안정성, 보안을 향상하기 위한 실행 가능한 권장 사항"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:38
msgid "Guidance on best practices for future system maintenance."
msgstr "향후 시스템 유지 관리를 위한 모범 사례 안내"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:41
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "도움 받기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/request-server-health-check.rst:43
msgid ""
"If you have any questions or need assistance, contact your Customer "
"Success Manager or Technical Account Manager, the `Mattermost Support "
"Team <https://mattermost.com/support/>`_, or visit the `Mattermost Help "
"Center <https://support.mattermost.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"질문이 있거나 도움이 필요한 경우 Customer Success Manager 또는 Technical Account Manager, "
"`Mattermost Support Team <https://mattermost.com/support/>`_\\ 에 문의하거나 `Mattermost Help "
"Center <https://support.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 를 방문하세요."
